file tools/fixtures/i/index_shelf_repair_control.sh 24 behaviors, the postcondition shown from both sides
file tools/fixtures/i/index_row_bound_scan.sh the refusal now names its repair
file tools/fixtures/i/index_row_bound_control.sh proves the advice line stands
