recommend keep-going -- the ranking names its own next lap: declared_ceiling 93s, borrowed_number 64s, width_check 60s and lantern_face 50s are the four costliest unmapped guards, and mapping any one of them is a bounded read of what that guard gates. Ahead of them sits the question the map cannot answer today -- which unmapped guards are DISCOVERY on purpose -- and that is a survey worth its own lap.
